1.0.0 2026-09-13

 - Initial public release accompanying Raccah, Agarwal, Zhu & Turk-Browne,
   "The human hippocampus supports auditory coding and multisensory integration",
   PLOS Biology (2026).
 - Raw BIDS data for 32 participants: T1w, T2w, nine functional runs, fieldmaps,
   and trial-level events.
 - Derivatives: fMRIPrep 23.2.1 (native T1w and MNI152NLin2009cAsym),
   FreeSurfer 7.3.2, ASHS hippocampal subfield segmentations, manual
   anterior/posterior hippocampal masks, Harvard-Oxford cortical ROIs.
 - T1w images defaced with pydeface, including all whole-head anatomical
   volumes in derivatives. T2w is a limited-coverage oblique slab containing no
   facial features and is released unmodified.
